    "text": "BY VIRTUE of the powers vested in me by Subsection (2) of section 6 of the Civil Aviation Act, No. 14 of 2010, I, ArjunaRanatunga, Minister of Transport and Civil Aviation, do by this Order, amend the Order made under section 6 of theaforesaid Act, and published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1922/4 of July 7th, 2015, by the substitution for thewords, \u201cMattala Rajapakse International Airport, Mattala, Hambantota\u201d of the words \u201cthe Mattala Rajapakse InternationalAirport, Mattala, Hambantota, the Colombo International Airport, Ratmalana, the Jaffna International Airport and theBatticaloa International Airport\u201d.",
